    "description": "Objective\n\nCreate list views to surface flagged and open records for reps and management review.\n\nImplementation Requirements\n\nSign-Up: Open, Flagged for Review, Flagged for Fraud\n\nPlayer: Flagged for Review, Flagged for Fraud\n\nOperator & Partner: basic \"All\" list views\n\nAcceptance Criteria\n\nAll list views created, filters return correct records, added to Console app navigation (POC-14)\n\nTesting Notes\n\nValidate against seeded sample data (POC-11)\n\nAdditional Notes\n\nOverlaps partially with POC-14's original list view set (My Open Sign-Ups, Overdue Sign-Ups, Clicks - Review Required, Active Deals by Partner) — reconcile naming with POC-14 before building to avoid duplicate views.\n\n\\----------------------------------------\n\nEstimate: XS · \\~3h · Dependencies: POC-09, POC-10, POC-14 · Ticket POC-21 (approved 2026-07-07)\n\nSource: Raised during internal POC review, 2026-07-07.",
