          "id": "10396",
          "body": "Closing as Won't Do — superseded.\n\nThe list view set that actually shipped is defined in BUILD-17 (Doc #12): All, Archived, New, Queue, Overdue, Flagged, Fraudulent Sign Ups — with a standard column order of Player Name / Operator / Time Since Sign Up / ... / Status.\n\nThe fraud view redefinition (post BUILD-18 status change) is handled by BUILD-48 (Doc #35), and the owner-only filter before go-live is BUILD-37 (Doc #14).\n\nThis ticket's own notes already flagged the overlap risk with POC-14. Closing rather than reconciling.",
